# 7. All the websites in one place

You do not need every resource here. Pick one main resource for each area and finish it. Switching between five courses for the same topic is one of the most common ways students waste months.

## Python

| Website | Address | Use it for |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| CS50P (Harvard) | cs50.harvard.edu/python | Free, structured Python course with problem sets |
| Python official docs | docs.python.org | Reference and the official tutorial |
| Real Python | realpython.com | Clear articles on any Python topic |
| Python Tutor | pythontutor.com | Visualising how your code runs step by step |
| HackerRank | hackerrank.com | Python and SQL practice tracks, certificates |

